(7634135, 1238011, 173844, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Lydia, for ribboning (this sense of the word isn''t accounted for in the various online dictionaries, though it seems apropos for our purposes) with this fine image.  I like that we can see its ephemeral nature, as its new incarnation is being born.  Also, the road across the way does acknowledge continuity.</td>', 'Congratulations, Lydia, for ribboning (this sense of the word isn''t accounted for in the various online dictionaries, though it seems apropos for our purposes) with this fine image.  I like that we can see its ephemeral nature, as its new incarnation is being born.  Also, the road across the way does acknowledge continuity.', '2019-07-03 08:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
